# India-Specific Regex Whitelist for Pi-hole
# Protects critical Indian government and financial domains from being blocked
# Updated: 2026-11-08

# Protect all .gov.in domains (Indian government services)
(^|\.)gov\.in$

# Protect all .nic.in domains (National Informatics Centre)
(^|\.)nic\.in$

# Protect all .ac.in domains (Indian academic institutions)
(^|\.)ac\.in$

# Protect .bank.in and .fin.in TLDs (RBI regulated financial domains)
(^|\.)bank\.in$
(^|\.)fin\.in$

